{
 "file": "EN/EVENT_DATA/MESSAGE/E700/E749_000.BMD",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MND_000_0_1#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Makoto and I roamed the[n]snowy Shibuya streets[n]for quite some time...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "Everywhere is quite crowded during[n]the Christmas season...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "Plus all the couples look so happy[n]together...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Did you have fun?[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "We can't lose to them.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I envy them.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "...Yes!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "Oh come on...!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "Oh come on...!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "So... what should we do now?[n]We're finally alone together...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "This isn't any different than usual, is it...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Let's just relax.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_006_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Let's have some fun.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_006_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You make every moment special.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "That sounds good to me.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "Should we have bought some[n]Christmas crackers?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "How can you say that with a straight face?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_009_5_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I won't be able to see Makoto[n]again after tomorrow...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_009_5_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "We spent a long time talking...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "...Oh, yes. Here.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "It's a present for you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "I hope you like it...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_012_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Thanks.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "Дякую.[clr 27]",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_012_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "This makes me happy.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "Handle it with care.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_016_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "I-I don't mean to change the subject[n]so suddenly...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_017_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "But my sister has been handling[n]the Shido case. Seems like she's[n]run into some trouble...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_017_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "Not quite sure on what though...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_017_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "All she's told me, is that they're having[n]a hard time getting people to testify[n]against him.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "I trust my sister, and... I'm sure she'll[n]do her job well...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "But, it's a little scary, not knowing[n]what might happen...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "If that happens, there's no telling what[n]they'll do to you or your teammates.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "There's even the possibility that they'll[n]fabricate a crime and move to arrest[n]you all.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I have to turn myself in to[n]make sure Makoto stays safe...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "But telling her about it would[n]only cause her to panic...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "...What's wrong?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's nothing.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_019_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'm sorry.",
   "uk": "Вибачте.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "Wh-What do you mean...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "......",
   "uk": "......",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "I-I'm sorry for bringing up such[n]a strange topic. On Christmas Eve,[n]no less...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_022_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "I'll be going now.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll walk you back.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_023_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Be careful.",
   "uk": "Будь обережний.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "...No, I'm fine.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_025_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "I will...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "Hey... you're keeping something[n]from me, aren't you...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_028_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "...Never mind.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_028_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "Good night.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_029_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I made Makoto worry...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_029_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Even so, this is the only way...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
}